SUMMARY:Pints at the Playground
DESCRIPTION:Days off school can be crazy\, so grab the family and a pint to go and head to Mt. Merrill for funsies for everyone. Thanks to the Bullpen social district you can enjoy Glass Jug brews and cocktails on the move\, a great way to keep you happy as they play. PLUS FREE kids charcuterie while supplies last! \nView on Facebook. \nHappens on the following Dates:\nJul 3\, 2026\, 2:00pm to 6:00pm\nAug 21\, 2026\, 2:00pm to 6:00pm\nSep 7\, 2026\, 2:00pm to 6:00pm\nOct 12\, 2026\, 2:00pm to 6:00pm\nNov 11\, 2026\, 2:00pm to 6:00pm\nDec 24\, 2026\, 2:00pm to 6:00pm
