SUMMARY:Views from the Durham
DESCRIPTION:To the stars. Join us on the Roof Tuesday\, July 21st for our stargazing series hosted byMorehead Planetarium and Science Center. Come up to the open-air Roof for telescopic stargazing with Morehead educators and music from DJ Skylan. In this session\, educators will be focusing on a first quarter moon and Venus. \nDJ Skylan will spin 8:30–10:30pm. Stargazing will take place 8:30–10:30pm. The Roof opens at 5pm so you can kick off the night with shareable plates\, craft cocktails\, and sunset views. Sip on our featured cocktail\, The Saturn\, all night long. \nThis event is free and open to the public. All ages are welcome.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/views-from-the-durham-6/
LOCATION:The Durham Hotel\, 315 E Chapel Hill Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Outdoors,Science & Technology
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/TheDurhamRooftop-AstronomyNight-13.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="The Durham Hotel":MAILTO:events@thedurham.com
GEO:35.9971857;-78.900891
