SUMMARY:Take the Mic: Open Mic Night at Market on Market
DESCRIPTION:Take the mic or come enjoy the show at Open Mic Night at Market on Market! \nJoin us on July 22 from 6:30–8:30 PM for an evening of music\, poetry\, spoken word\, storytelling\, and more. Whether you are an experienced performer\, trying something new\, or simply looking for a fun night out in downtown Durham\, everyone is welcome. \nBring your voice\, your creativity\, and your people. Performers can share their talent in a supportive and relaxed environment\, while guests can sit back\, enjoy the performances\, and shop three locally owned businesses under one roof. \nAdmission is $5 per person. \nCome for the talent\, stay for the community\, and experience a different side of Market on Market.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/take-the-mic-open-mic-night-at-market-on-market/
